<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tenet raised by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tenet raised by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Tenet HealthCare to a near-term buy from accumulate, keeping it as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 27.</p>
